Package: ragnar-backgrounds
Version: 1.0-3
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Jörg Schröder <projekt@lieraos.local>
Installed-Size: 4000
Section: graphics
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/LieraOS
Description: Background images for the Ragnar desktop
 Default set of desktop background images for Ragnar, the
 Wayland desktop environment of LiEra OS. The images are
 registered through gnome-background-properties and appear in
 the appearance section of ragnar-settings.
